  <entry>
    <title>1024程序节学习复盘</title>
    <link href="https://myrvyn.github.io/posts/759850e3.html"/>
    <id>https://myrvyn.github.io/posts/759850e3.html</id>
    <published>2026-10-24T04:21:25.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-10-24T05:10:31.587Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<blockquote><p>今天跟着“1024程序员节”的课表开始学 Python。上午的进度虽然只推进了两节（复习基础语法 + 函数）为了防止自己“学了就忘”，我把上午的踩坑记录和知识理解整理了一下。</p></blockquote><h3 id="一、-被-while-和-break-折磨">一、 被 while 和 break 折磨</h3><p>今天写的第一个完整程序是“重启终端：口令 1024”。代码虽然不长，但我调了好几次。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">check_count = <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">while</span> <span class="literal">True</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> check_count == <span class="number">3</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;今天打卡已上限，去休息吧&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">break</span></span><br><span class="line">    task = <span class="built_in">input</span>(<span class="string">&quot;请输入今天的学习内容(输入exit退出): &quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> task == <span class="string">&quot;exit&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;终端已关闭&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">break</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> task == <span class="string">&quot;1024&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        check_count += <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">f&quot;打卡成功，当前已打卡<span class="subst">&#123;check_count&#125;</span>/3个。&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;-&quot;</span> * <span class="number">20</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>最后那句可以不写的,就是看起来更美观一点</p></blockquote><p>给自己记下的两个教训：</p><ol><li><strong>check_count = 0</strong> 必须写在 while 外面！ 我今天才彻底搞懂，如果把这个记分牌写在 while 里面，每次循环一开始，分数就被强行清零了，永远也攒不够 3 次。</li><li>不加 break 就是无尽折磨。 while True 是个无底洞，如果我不写 break 去结束它，即使输入了 <strong>exit</strong> ，程序也会继续问我“请输入今日学习内容”。</li></ol><h3 id="二、-懂了，但没完全懂的函数（参数和返回值）">二、 懂了，但没完全懂的函数（参数和返回值）</h3><p>今天重点学了 def 定义函数。我把函数整合到了打卡器里，写了进阶版的代码：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">calculate_exp</span>(<span class="params">times</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    base_exp = times * <span class="number">10</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> times &gt;= <span class="number">3</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        base_exp += <span class="number">50</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> base_exp</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ... 这里为了方便省略了while循环，主程序是前面标题一的那个代码 ...</span></span><br><span class="line">        my_exp = calculate_exp(check_count)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">f&quot;获得经验值：<span class="subst">&#123;my_exp&#125;</span> 点！&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong><em>脑补</em></strong>：print 和 return 到底差在哪？<br>这是今天最卡我的地方。我还以为写个函数让它打印出来就完事了，今天才明白：</p><ul><li>return 是交还结果：函数算完账，用 return 把数据悄悄塞回给外面的变量（my_exp），这一步在屏幕上是看不见的。</li><li>print 只是让你看个响：外面拿到了 my_exp 这个数据后，我再写个 print，屏幕上才会出现“获得经验值”。</li><li>总结：没 return，外面的程序就接不到数据；没 print，我就看不到结果。</li></ul>]]></content>
    
    
      
      
    <summary type="html">&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;今天跟着“1024程序员节”的课表开始学 Python。上午的进度虽然只推进了两节（复习基础语法 + 函数）为了防止自己“学了就忘”，我把上午的踩坑记录和知识理解整理了一下。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;一、-被-while</summary>
      
    
    
    
    
